4. Classify as card_bound_r2 if any of the string values under assignment-ref keys match `^audit-r2-` (or contains `audit-r2-`).
   - Extract card_id = the matching ref (longest match).
   - target: from target_id/node_id or from card id token: `audit-r2-<target>(-bindchain-worker-XXX)?`.
